et sextantem, lat. tres pedes cum triente.</HI></CAPTION> <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0740577A" TEXT="[Inscription]"></ORNAMENT> <P COM="0575">CINGEBANT LATICES MONTEM TENEROQVE MEATV
