HAEC CVRAVIT MERCVRIVS LEVITA FIDELIS</P> <CAPTION COM="0575">4.  <HI REND="ITALIC">In ecclesia SS. Quatuor Coronatorum Fragmentum posteriori parte recenter suppletum. In muro.</HI></CAPTION> <ORNAMENT IMAGE="0740577B" TEXT="[Inscription]"></ORNAMENT> <P COM="0575">EXTREMO TVMVLVS LATVIT SVB AGGERE MONTIS
