 <COL N="0709"></COL> <HI REND=BOLD>59</HI>  Eudoxiam Arcadii uxorem infestissimam patitur <NOTE N="a" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0709" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0709A"></COL> Sicut Justina Ambrosium, ita etiam Eudoxiam
